  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsOtherMember">同上</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesLessThanOneUnitMember">同上</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:TreasurySharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4"&gt;② 【自己株式等】&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:384.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;現在&lt;/p&gt;
