  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(注) １．取締役　岡本　毅、肥塚　見春、貝阿彌　誠、佐竹　彰、諏訪　貴子、伊藤　弥生、&lt;/span&gt;大枝　宏之、&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:89pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;木村　美代子、進藤　孝生、塩野　紀子は、社外取締役であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
